{"abstract":"Writing and genre conventions are extant to any scientific community, and CHI is no different. In this paper, we present the early phases of an AI tool called KITSUNE, which takes text and adapts it toward the writing conventions of a CHI paper. We describe the development of the tool with the intent to promote discussion around how writing conventions are upheld and unquestioned by the CHI community, and how this translates to the work produced. In addition, we bring up questions surrounding how the introduction of LLMs into academic writing will fundamentally change how conventions will be upheld now and in the future.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Robinson, Raquel","Alvarez, Alberto","Mekler, Elisa"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-747247"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Malmö University"],"keyword":["AI","Artificial intelligence","CHI","LLMs","writing conventions"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"how to write a chi paper asking for a friend","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/105577670/3613905.3644051.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-747247","identifier":[{"id":"85194168851","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-8cbb36c9-52bf-4247-b237-85b5a0e31aa9"],"keyword":["AI","CHI","LLMs","artificial intelligence","writing conventions"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A57D600E7080D8DBC56813599FADDDF2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/105577670/3613905.3644051.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Human-Centered Data Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"se","key":"malmö university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Malmö University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Raquel","key":"robinsonpau","last":"Robinson","locid":"cb1b6c5f-6206-4a35-b8aa-6a750f9c89a1","name":"Robinson, Raquel","orcid":"0000-0003-4933-7168","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Alberto","key":"alvarezpau","last":"Alvarez","name":"Alvarez, Alberto","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Elisa","key":"meklerpau","last":"Mekler","locid":"cf6cfa0b-e3ac-4164-8de2-b956d8e23825","name":"Mekler, Elisa","orcid":"0000-0003-0076-6703","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3613905.3644051","isbn":["9798400703317"],"status":"p","title":"CHI EA '24: Extended Abstracts of the 2024 CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85194168851"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-8cbb36c9-52bf-4247-b237-85b5a0e31aa9"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"How to write a CHI paper (asking for a friend)","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-747247","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Videogames can transform the perspectives and attitudes of players. Prior discussion on this transformative potential has typically been limited to non-entertainment videogames with explicit transformational goals. However, recreational gaming appears to hold considerable potential for igniting deeply personal experiences of profound transformation in players. Towards understanding this phenomenon, we conducted an explorative autoethnographic study. For this, the first author played five narrative-driven videogames while collecting self-observational and self-reflective data of his experience during and outside gameplay. Our findings offer intimate insights into the trajectory and emotional qualities of personally meaningful and transformative videogame experiences. For example, we found that gameplay experiences that were initially perceived as bewildering or disorienting could evolve into more harmonious experiences laden with personal meaning. This shift in experience developed through different forms of subsequent re-engagement with initially discrepant game encounters.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Väkevä, Jaakko","Mekler, Elisa","Lindqvist, Janne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-747256"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland"],"glorg":["Aalto University","All Global Affiliations"],"keyword":["Autoethnographic study","Narrative driven games","Personal meaning in gameplay","Recreational videogames","Transformative gaming"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"from disorientation to harmony autoethnographic insights into transformative videogame experiences","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3613904.3642543","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-747256","identifier":[{"id":"85194887215","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-abb23a26-4b1d-4346-879b-261db7aaade2"],"keyword":["Autoethnographic study","Narrative-driven games","Personal meaning in gameplay","Recreational videogames","Transformative gaming"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4A3A62DF727078AFD3CB6F82B79AD950"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3613904.3642543","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fi","key":"aalto university","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Aalto University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Human-Centered Data Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jaakko","key":"väkeväpau","last":"Väkevä","name":"Väkevä, Jaakko","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Elisa","key":"meklerpau","last":"Mekler","locid":"cf6cfa0b-e3ac-4164-8de2-b956d8e23825","name":"Mekler, Elisa","orcid":"0000-0003-0076-6703","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Janne","key":"lindqvistpau","last":"Lindqvist","name":"Lindqvist, Janne","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3613904.3642543","pages":"1-20","status":"p","title":"CHI '24: Proceedings of the CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85194887215"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-abb23a26-4b1d-4346-879b-261db7aaade2"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"From Disorientation to Harmony: Autoethnographic Insights into Transformative Videogame Experiences","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-747256","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
