{"abstract":"It is heavily debated within the gamification community whether specific game elements may actually undermine users' intrinsic motivation. This online experiment examined the effects of three commonly employed game design elements - points, leaderboard, levels - on users' performance, intrinsic motivation, perceived autonomy and competence in an image annotation task. Implementation of these game elements significantly increased performance, but did not affect perceived autonomy, competence or intrinsic motivation. Our findings suggest that points, levels and leaderboards by themselves neither make nor break users' intrinsic motivation in non-game contexts. Instead, it is assumed that they act as progress indicators, guiding and enhancing user performance. While more research on the contextual factors that may potentially mediate the effects of game elements on intrinsic motivation is required, it seems that the implementation of points, levels, and leaderboards is a viable means to promote specific user behavior in non-game contexts.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Mekler, Elisa D.","Brühlmann, Florian","Opwis, Klaus","Tuch, Alexandre N."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-402635"],"event":{"end":"2013-10-04","place":"Toronto, ca","start":"2013-10-02","title":"1st International Conference on Gameful Design, Research, and Applications","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Basel"],"keyword":["Game design elements","Gameful design","Gamification","Motivation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"do points levels and leaderboards harm intrinsic motivation an empirical analysis of common gamification elements","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-402635","identifier":[{"id":"84905457954","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-0f74f9c8-1c7f-4c08-a9c9-d4c6d56eeaa4"],"keyword":["Game design elements","Gameful design","Gamification","Motivation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1C5A0C0C15F30A6A2F124CE9568CCBFF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ch","key":"university of basel","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Basel","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Elisa D.","key":"meklerpau","last":"Mekler","name":"Mekler, Elisa D.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Florian","key":"brühlmannpau","last":"Brühlmann","name":"Brühlmann, Florian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Klaus","key":"opwispau","last":"Opwis","name":"Opwis, Klaus","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Alexandre N.","key":"tuchpau","last":"Tuch","name":"Tuch, Alexandre N.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/2583008.2583017","isbn":["9781450328159"],"pages":"66-73","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","subtitle":"Proceedings of the First International Conference on Gameful Design, Research, and Applications","title":"Gamification '13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84905457954"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-0f74f9c8-1c7f-4c08-a9c9-d4c6d56eeaa4"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Do points, levels and leaderboards harm intrinsic motivation? An empirical analysis of common gamification elements","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-402635","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
